{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15204410","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15204410","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1520441001:0":{"text":"Mom! Dad! It's me! Can you hear me?","source_cn":"妈妈！妈妈，是我！爸爸……爸爸，妈妈……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5E11BD08B9CCF81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1520441002:1":{"text":"Stop shouting. They can't respond.","source_cn":"别喊了，他们没法回应你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADE4F257C8F1F444","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1520441003:1":{"text":"This spell is undeveloped. Their souls have been gone too long, it's difficult to pull them back.","source_cn":"亡灵魔法的研究还不成熟，再加上他们已经死去太久，灵魂难...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48C141C8127C0400","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1520441004:0":{"text":"Right now, I can only project their spiritual forms. I can't bring back their true consciousness.","source_cn":"现在，我最多只能再次展现他们的灵体，但无法让灵体真正地...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16E19EF05E058C3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1520441005:1":{"text":"That's the best I can do.","source_cn":"我只能做到这些了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3441A6654C6C67DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1520441006:0":{"text":"... That's okay, Mister Mage! Just seeing them again... that's more than enough for me.","source_cn":"……没关系的，魔法师大人！能再次见到爸爸妈妈，我已经很...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x045708BA807D2E71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1520441007:0":{"text":"I have so much to tell them. Even if they can't speak back... it still means everything.","source_cn":"我有好多好多话想和他们说……就算爸爸妈妈不会再回应我也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFCD465D47AB436F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1520441008:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, let's give him some space.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x485629B09A1B7C1F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, let's give him some space.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, let's give him some space.","variant_male_record_index":"184673","variant_female_record_index":"184674","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1520441009:0":{"text":"Let him have this moment to say goodbye to his parents...","source_cn":"给托洛留一些时间……让他独自完成和父母的告别吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CC35106C695A063","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","d